Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:57:34 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] SystemUI: add music chip to status bar island

Adds MusicChipViewModel, which mirrors the active media session (title and
app icon) as a secondary ongoing-activity chip. It ranks after the primary
chips so it shows as the second chip when another activity is active.
Gated by the music_dynamic_island_enabled system setting (default on).

